{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_96FB266F","title":"Kai visits the noodle stand","entry":"Dlg_96FB266F::entry","exit":"Dlg_96FB266F::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_E40C79DF","articyId":"72057628397670559","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Kai Reston","text":"Noodle crew, noodle crew, every light is shining on the noodle crew. So, what's in the crew's brew for the six o'clock news?","speakerId":"Ntt_7107220B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Noodle crew, noodle crew, every light is shining on the noodle crew. So, what's in the crew's brew for the six o'clock news?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":-500.0,"y":200.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26447","byteOffset":17887096,"byteLength":432}},{"id":"DFr_516A63DA","articyId":"72057628397670573","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Kai Reston","text":"First, we see the city gleam, like it wants to say something, tell us a secret, whisper in our ear--AANNNNDDD cut feed to the HOVAs racing toward Meridian Market and the people walking the street beneath the blurry shadows. This is the living, breathing, city of Nivalis.","speakerId":"Ntt_7107220B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"First, we see the city gleam, like it wants to say something, tell us a secret, whisper in our ear--AANNNNDDD cut feed to the HOVAs racing toward Meridian Market and the people walking the street beneath the blurry shadows. This is the living, breathing, city of Nivalis.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":750.0,"y":150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25205","byteOffset":17417792,"byteLength":628}},{"id":"DFr_952AFCE6","articyId":"72057628397670594","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Kai Reston","text":"This is the part where you say something. Don't be shy, the audience wants to hear.","speakerId":"Ntt_7107220B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"This is the part where you say something. Don't be shy, the audience wants to hear.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":1337.3333740234375,"y":75.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43069","byteOffset":30623576,"byteLength":392}},{"id":"DFr_2482C313","articyId":"72057628397670601","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Kai Reston","text":"I most certainly have... NOT! I was going to. I was right there, ready to fluff the pillows and crawl under my sheets when BAM! My brain exploded in front of our studio audience.","speakerId":"Ntt_7107220B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I most certainly have... NOT! I was going to. I was right there, ready to fluff the pillows and crawl under my sheets when BAM! My brain exploded in front of our studio audience.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":1337.3333740234375,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48249","byteOffset":32590168,"byteLength":496}},{"id":"DFr_E655EE33","articyId":"72057628397670628","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Kai Reston","text":"Well! Whose fault is that? I'll tell yah whose... mine! And he's off! Off to work ol' chum. Ciao, ciao, ciao!","speakerId":"Ntt_7107220B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well! Whose fault is that? I'll tell yah whose... mine! And he's off! Off to work ol' chum. Ciao, ciao, ciao!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":1925.3333740234375,"y":200.0},"source":{"file":"resource